I am in the kitchen and I am hungry.
I open the kitchen cupboards.
They are almost empty.
I see no bread.
Then I open the fridge.
It is also empty.
I find no cheese.
I see a tomato, but it is not fresh.
That is not good.
I need fresh groceries.
I am sitting at the table now.
I take the pen.
I write a shopping list.
What do I want for the week?
I drink coffee every morning.
So I need coffee.
I like cheese a lot, and I often cook rice.
I write that on the list.
I also need vegetables for dinner.
My shopping list is ready now.
